                <note rend="inline" type="source">811F.504/354: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Panamá</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dawson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-10-12T13:00:00-05:00">October 12, 1940—1
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>150. Your 178, October 11, 4 p.m. Interview authorized. Please expedite
                    reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
